WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.480 --> 00:12.039
[Episode 6]

3
00:22.360 --> 00:23.441
Wan.

4
00:23.441 --> 00:25.000
You're awake.

5
00:26.160 --> 00:27.180
Zhi Xuan.

6
00:27.180 --> 00:29.361
Did you bring me to the hospital?

7
00:36.680 --> 00:38.120
Mr. Zhao.

8
00:41.000 --> 00:42.840
Why are you here?

9
00:45.161 --> 00:47.880
Zhao Sheng Ge saved you from the side of the road.

10
00:48.601 --> 00:51.400
Ms. Xu said you saved her.

11
00:51.400 --> 00:52.961
Those people...

12
00:52.961 --> 00:54.880
They're likely from Baihe Hall.

13
00:56.000 --> 00:57.601
Are you feeling better?

14
01:02.601 --> 01:04.440
Did they have guns?

15
01:09.840 --> 01:11.400
I don't think they had guns,

16
01:11.400 --> 01:13.441
but they were likely armed.

17
01:13.441 --> 01:17.721
The trunks of the two Jeep A67s were riding low.

18
01:17.721 --> 01:20.720
Original parts, no license plates.

19
01:21.641 --> 01:24.760
Cars like that are usually used for illegal border crossings.

20
01:24.760 --> 01:27.001
You certainly remember those details clearly.

21
01:27.001 --> 01:28.361
Is your hand injury serious?

22
01:28.361 --> 01:30.000
Does your head hurt?

23
01:30.721 --> 01:31.801
I'm much better.

24
01:31.801 --> 01:33.040
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

25
01:33.040 --> 01:35.641
Chen Wan, they were coming for me.

26
01:35.641 --> 01:37.521
Since you got involved,

27
01:37.521 --> 01:39.087
I should compensate and thank you.

28
01:39.087 --> 01:40.680
That's not necessary.

29
01:40.680 --> 01:41.707
Ms. Xu already gave me...

30
01:41.707 --> 01:43.881
Her thanks are hers. This is a separate matter.

31
01:46.161 --> 01:47.521
Excuse me.

32
01:50.881 --> 01:51.881
Hello?

33
01:51.881 --> 01:54.161
Where's Chen Wan? I want to see him.

34
02:02.634 --> 02:04.361
How are you feeling?

35
02:04.361 --> 02:06.207
Mr. Tan, I'm fine.

36
02:06.207 --> 02:08.640
It's just some soft tissue contusions.

37
02:08.640 --> 02:11.241
The doctor insisted I stay for a few days.

38
02:11.241 --> 02:13.041
He's worried about a concussion.

39
02:13.041 --> 02:14.801
I knew Zhi Xuan was talking nonsense.

40
02:14.801 --> 02:15.961
I wasn't talking nonsense!

41
02:15.961 --> 02:17.201
He really does have a concussion.

42
02:17.201 --> 02:18.880
His head is all messed up.

43
02:18.880 --> 02:20.840
Just look at his face right now.

44
02:20.840 --> 02:22.280
He's practically disfigured.

45
02:22.280 --> 02:23.841
I'm fine.

46
02:25.880 --> 02:27.321
That does look pretty bad.

47
02:27.321 --> 02:29.201
Tell you what, get some good rest.

48
02:29.201 --> 02:32.160
When you're discharged, we'll throw you a party.

49
02:32.160 --> 02:33.820
Okay.

50
02:33.820 --> 02:35.280
Chen Wan.

51
02:35.280 --> 02:38.120
Do you know who you risked your life to save?

52
02:38.120 --> 02:40.560
Zhao Sheng Ge's fiancée.

53
02:40.560 --> 02:42.241
They've really crossed the line.

54
02:42.241 --> 02:44.000
Zhao Sheng Ge won't let them get away with it.

55
02:44.000 --> 02:45.840
Fiancée?

56
02:45.840 --> 02:47.360
Did you decide that?

57
02:48.801 --> 02:50.321
I wouldn't dare decide for you.

58
02:50.321 --> 02:52.081
It was in the Hai City Evening News.

59
02:52.081 --> 02:55.280
"Financial giant Zhao Sheng Ge and the eldest daughter of the Xu family..."

60
02:55.280 --> 02:58.560
"visit Repulse Bay Garden to build their love nest."

61
02:58.560 --> 03:00.321
You wrote that yourself, didn't you?

62
03:00.321 --> 03:02.361
It's in all the news.

63
03:02.361 --> 03:04.241
They saw you dining with her at Sefton.

64
03:04.241 --> 03:05.840
See? Look.

65
03:05.840 --> 03:07.081
Everyone knows about it.

66
03:07.081 --> 03:08.361
It's not just me who saw it.

67
03:08.361 --> 03:09.840
Right?

68
03:09.840 --> 03:11.521
The whole world knows.

69
03:11.521 --> 03:13.361
I'm not just making things up.

70
03:13.361 --> 03:16.160
Does having dinner mean an engagement?

71
03:16.160 --> 03:18.961
Ms. Xu and I are not getting engaged.

72
03:18.961 --> 03:21.321
But I reserve the right to sue you and the gossip magazines...

73
03:21.321 --> 03:23.920
for spreading rumors and violating my privacy.

74
03:27.321 --> 03:28.880
What?

75
03:28.880 --> 03:30.441
You've seen it too?

76
03:32.241 --> 03:33.761
No, I haven't.

77
03:33.761 --> 03:35.321
Whether it's true or not,

78
03:35.321 --> 03:37.560
this whole thing happened because of you.

79
03:37.560 --> 03:39.921
You have to take responsibility, Zhao Sheng Ge.

80
03:39.921 --> 03:42.000
Chen Wan, make him pay a heavy price.

81
03:42.000 --> 03:43.561
It's what you deserve.

82
03:45.801 --> 03:46.801
Family members, please sign here.

83
03:46.801 --> 03:48.440
Who is the patient's family?

84
03:48.440 --> 03:49.920
I'll do it.

85
03:56.081 --> 03:58.160
Listen, Ms. Xu...

86
03:58.160 --> 03:59.241
All right.

87
03:59.241 --> 04:00.600
Let's not disturb Chen Wan's rest.

88
04:00.600 --> 04:02.041
Let's go.

89
04:37.321 --> 04:38.921
Thank you.

90
04:41.001 --> 04:42.761
Does the IV drip hurt?

91
04:42.761 --> 04:44.200
No.

92
04:46.001 --> 04:48.400
This isn't an engagement ring.

93
04:48.400 --> 04:50.481
It's the Zhao family crest.

94
04:51.400 --> 04:54.121
What the newspapers wrote is all nonsense.

95
04:54.121 --> 04:55.840
Minglong and Baisheng don't need a marriage alliance

96
04:55.840 --> 04:58.160
to make the Lychee Bay project a success.

97
04:58.160 --> 04:59.800
Mr. Zhao, you don't need to explain these things to me.

98
04:59.800 --> 05:01.160
I do.

99
05:05.441 --> 05:07.001
You're very afraid of me.

100
05:09.054 --> 05:10.961
- No, I'm not. - No?

101
05:10.961 --> 05:12.400
No.

102
05:14.681 --> 05:16.521
It's good if you aren't.

103
05:16.521 --> 05:18.001
There's no need to be afraid of me.

104
05:21.121 --> 05:22.441
Chen Wan.

105
05:24.561 --> 05:26.160
Don't be afraid of me.

106
05:34.761 --> 05:37.600
The doctor suggests you stay in the hospital for a few more days.

107
05:37.600 --> 05:39.761
I'll just stay tonight for observation.

108
05:39.761 --> 05:41.201
If there's nothing else today, I...

109
05:41.201 --> 05:42.920
Follow the doctor's advice.

110
05:42.920 --> 05:44.761
Don't just do what you think is best.

111
05:44.761 --> 05:48.400
If I arrange for some people to be outside your ward,

112
05:48.400 --> 05:50.200
would that bother you?

113
05:51.160 --> 05:53.521
Before those desperados are caught,

114
05:53.521 --> 05:56.280
they might very well come back for revenge.

115
05:56.280 --> 05:58.801
I want them here to watch over you.

116
06:00.160 --> 06:03.160
- All right. - I'll hire someone else to take care of you.

117
06:03.160 --> 06:05.720
- But would that be... - Or you can...

118
06:05.720 --> 06:08.081
Just consider it a favor owed.

119
06:08.081 --> 06:09.920
When you've decided on how to return it,

120
06:09.920 --> 06:11.600
let me know anytime.

121
06:14.201 --> 06:16.360
Chen Wan.

122
06:16.360 --> 06:17.761
The patient's constitution is weak.

123
06:17.761 --> 06:20.081
The injury near the brain is very dangerous.

124
06:20.081 --> 06:21.321
He shouldn't lie flat for too long.

125
06:21.321 --> 06:23.720
Please adjust the head of the bed for him.

126
07:14.600 --> 07:17.920
Mr. Zhao, will being out for so long affect your schedule?

127
07:17.920 --> 07:19.360
If you have things to do,

128
07:19.360 --> 07:20.400
why don't you head back first?

129
07:20.400 --> 07:21.920
No need.

130
07:21.920 --> 07:24.280
I only need to make an appearance on stage.

131
07:25.201 --> 07:28.840
Giving lectures, speaking as a representative,

132
07:28.840 --> 07:30.240
or entertaining guests...

133
07:30.240 --> 07:31.761
I don't have to do any of that.

134
07:31.761 --> 07:34.360
If you're tired, get some rest.

135
07:34.360 --> 07:37.080
I'll wait for Zhi Xuan to arrive, then I'll leave.

136
07:39.240 --> 07:40.961
Okay.

137
07:40.961 --> 07:42.801
It's raining outside.

138
07:43.961 --> 07:46.001
Remember to take an umbrella.

139
07:46.001 --> 07:47.881
Don't worry.

140
07:47.881 --> 07:49.441
I have one in my car.

141
07:49.441 --> 07:50.773
Go to sleep.

142
07:51.561 --> 07:52.881
Okay.

143
09:23.360 --> 09:24.920
Wan.

144
09:33.880 --> 09:34.961
I have matters to handle.

145
09:34.961 --> 09:35.961
I have to go now.

146
09:35.961 --> 09:37.721
Wait, Zhao Sheng Ge.

147
09:39.441 --> 09:40.600
He's asleep?

148
09:40.600 --> 09:41.881
Yes.

149
09:42.840 --> 09:44.921
He fell asleep...

150
09:44.921 --> 09:46.920
right in front of you?

151
09:49.321 --> 09:51.360
Thank you for taking care of him.

152
09:51.360 --> 09:53.560
Call the nurse when the IV is finished.

153
09:55.041 --> 09:56.440
Zhuo Zhi Xuan.

154
09:57.281 --> 09:59.401
Call the nurse when the IV is almost done.

155
09:59.401 --> 10:01.320
Contact me if anything happens.

156
10:02.600 --> 10:03.881
I'm off.

157
10:11.801 --> 10:14.040
Is this really Zhao Sheng Ge?

158
10:16.321 --> 10:17.640
- Viola. - Mr. Zhao.

159
10:17.640 --> 10:19.441
Ask Ms. Zhang to go to Renji Hospital

160
10:19.441 --> 10:20.447
to look after a patient for a few days.

161
10:20.447 --> 10:22.320
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

162
10:23.321 --> 10:26.201
Tell her to make more nutritious soup

163
10:26.201 --> 10:28.600
and give her a red packet.

164
10:28.600 --> 10:32.401
By the way, I need updates on the patient's recovery.

165
10:32.401 --> 10:34.600
Have her take photos when she's free.

166
10:34.600 --> 10:35.600
Understood.

167
10:35.600 --> 10:38.153
But don't make the patient uncomfortable.

168
10:38.153 --> 10:39.601
I understand.

169
10:40.933 --> 10:42.373
Bo Zhu.

170
10:43.068 --> 10:44.321
Eat slowly.

171
10:44.321 --> 10:45.441
Eat slowly. Be happy.

172
10:45.441 --> 10:46.561
Is the canned food good?

173
10:46.561 --> 10:47.801
We're so lucky today.

174
10:47.801 --> 10:49.081
The canned food hasn't expired yet.

175
10:49.081 --> 10:50.321
Eat slowly.

176
10:50.321 --> 10:51.720
Take it easy.

177
10:51.720 --> 10:54.121
Don't rush. Eat slowly.

178
10:54.760 --> 10:56.401
Look at you.

179
10:56.401 --> 10:59.240
Is the canned food too salty for it?

180
10:59.240 --> 11:00.880
S-Sir, we'll leave right away.

181
11:00.880 --> 11:02.260
We're leaving now.

182
11:02.260 --> 11:04.253
It's you.

183
11:04.253 --> 11:06.520
Don't bark.

184
11:06.520 --> 11:08.281
Don't worry.

185
11:08.281 --> 11:09.921
I have a dog, too.

186
11:09.921 --> 11:11.840
Her name was Bo Zhu.

187
11:11.840 --> 11:14.000
She loved canned food.

188
11:14.000 --> 11:17.401
But she'd lose her fur if she ate too much.

189
11:17.401 --> 11:19.880
We don't usually eat this.

190
11:19.880 --> 11:23.040
Bo Zhu loses her fur if she ate too much...

191
11:23.961 --> 11:26.000
Will it grow back if she eats less?

192
11:26.000 --> 11:28.161
It'll grow back very soon.

193
11:28.161 --> 11:32.081
And then, she'll be healthy again.

194
11:33.801 --> 11:35.560
We'll be going then, sir.

195
11:35.560 --> 11:38.320
- We're leaving right now. - I'm not here to chase you away.

196
11:39.041 --> 11:41.081
A friend of mine is sick.

197
11:41.081 --> 11:43.160
I'm here at the hospital to visit him.

198
11:45.561 --> 11:47.281
Go on and keep playing.

199
11:47.281 --> 11:48.613
Come here.

200
11:52.600 --> 11:53.961
Hello?

201
12:16.321 --> 12:20.040
Young master, the master wants you to go to class.

202
12:34.161 --> 12:36.121
Let's call you Bo Zhu, okay?

203
12:50.587 --> 12:52.086
- Lukas. - Mr. Zhao.

204
12:52.086 --> 12:55.440
About that boy at the shooting club I asked you to investigate...

205
12:56.360 --> 12:57.953
The boy from the parking lot?

206
12:57.953 --> 12:58.973
Yes.

207
12:58.973 --> 13:01.520
The boy who picks up bottles.

208
13:01.520 --> 13:04.161
Create a low-profile donation plan.

209
13:04.161 --> 13:06.273
Should the donation be in your name?

210
13:06.273 --> 13:07.600
No.

211
13:08.600 --> 13:10.880
Don't use my name.

212
13:10.880 --> 13:12.241
Understood.

213
15:33.681 --> 15:35.640
Lunatic.

214
16:19.921 --> 16:24.440
Your head... is really so round.

215
16:38.321 --> 16:39.841
Mr. Zhao.

216
16:43.120 --> 16:44.520
Wait a moment.

217
16:45.520 --> 16:46.833
Hello?

218
16:49.561 --> 16:50.920
The soup...

219
16:52.240 --> 16:53.640
It's nutritious?

220
16:54.801 --> 16:56.601
It's up to him whether he eats it or not.

221
16:57.240 --> 16:58.801
If he doesn't want it, forget it.

222
16:58.801 --> 17:00.201
It's up to him.

223
17:03.441 --> 17:05.320
Who was on the phone?

224
17:05.320 --> 17:06.881
The housekeeper from home.

225
17:06.881 --> 17:08.520
Did something happen?

226
17:08.520 --> 17:10.201
She recently got a kitten.

227
17:10.201 --> 17:12.320
It won't eat.

228
17:12.320 --> 17:14.600
Is this some kind of new dry humor?

229
17:22.161 --> 17:23.841
We're going to the hospital to visit Chen Wan.

230
17:23.841 --> 17:25.681
Zhi Xuan is going with him to bid on a painting at Bertha Island.

231
17:25.681 --> 17:26.714
We'll meet at the hospital.

232
17:26.714 --> 17:28.161
Are you coming?

233
17:30.240 --> 17:31.520
I'll pass.

234
17:31.520 --> 17:33.921
I have to go back to the old house tonight.

235
17:33.921 --> 17:35.881
The old man has been pressuring me lately.

236
17:35.881 --> 17:37.240
It's probably about the press conference.

237
17:37.240 --> 17:38.240
He wants to hold me accountable

238
17:38.240 --> 17:39.840
for what happened on the day of the festival.

239
17:40.681 --> 17:41.881
Fine.

240
17:41.881 --> 17:46.039
But you must attend Chen Wan's discharge party.

241
17:46.039 --> 17:47.040
Understand?

242
17:47.040 --> 17:50.080
After all, this whole thing happened because of you.

243
17:50.080 --> 17:52.000
We'll see.

244
17:52.000 --> 17:53.681
What's there to contemplate?

245
17:57.760 --> 17:59.280
What are you talking about?

246
18:01.240 --> 18:03.080
What are you two talking about?

247
18:07.161 --> 18:09.401
Your dear parents are rarely home,

248
18:09.401 --> 18:12.080
yet you don't even come back to see them.

249
18:12.080 --> 18:14.000
What have you been so busy with lately

250
18:14.000 --> 18:16.800
that you don't even have time to come home?

251
18:16.800 --> 18:18.800
I've been busy with some matters.

252
18:22.240 --> 18:24.520
What matters?

253
18:24.520 --> 18:27.481
Don't play word games with me.

254
18:28.361 --> 18:29.800
What?

255
18:30.441 --> 18:34.280
Do you think I'm too old to control you?

256
18:35.441 --> 18:37.560
Tell me.

257
18:37.560 --> 18:39.280
Regarding the Xu family,

258
18:39.280 --> 18:40.841
what are your plans?

259
18:40.841 --> 18:42.881
How are you going to answer to me?

260
18:42.881 --> 18:44.961
How will you answer to them?

261
18:44.961 --> 18:47.320
How will you answer to the public?

262
18:49.401 --> 18:51.760
First of all, my personal affairs

263
18:51.760 --> 18:54.121
don't need to be explained to anyone.

264
18:54.121 --> 18:57.441
Secondly, you were the one who leaked the news

265
18:57.441 --> 19:00.361
of the engagement without my knowledge.

266
19:00.361 --> 19:01.841
So, you should be the one

267
19:01.841 --> 19:03.361
to answer to the Xu family,

268
19:03.361 --> 19:05.841
and to the public.

269
19:05.841 --> 19:09.280
In fact, if I were to hold anyone accountable,

270
19:09.280 --> 19:11.161
you should be answering to me.

271
19:11.161 --> 19:13.240
What?

272
19:13.240 --> 19:16.120
I have to answer to you?

273
19:19.080 --> 19:22.761
Who did I do all this for?

274
19:23.720 --> 19:26.441
Don't forget.

275
19:26.441 --> 19:30.280
Minglong signed a ten-year plan with them.

276
19:30.280 --> 19:32.080
The financing for Bertha Island

277
19:32.080 --> 19:34.120
is still in the IPO stage.

278
19:35.320 --> 19:38.881
The Lychee Bay construction has just begun.

279
19:38.881 --> 19:40.921
So, I've restructured the financing.

280
19:40.921 --> 19:42.720
The site is ready to be subcontracted.

281
19:42.720 --> 19:43.841
As for the contract,

282
19:43.841 --> 19:46.361
I'll negotiate with them to terminate it.

283
19:46.361 --> 19:49.080
You... You traitor!

284
20:01.201 --> 20:03.761
You look down on Xu Zhi Ying?

285
20:04.601 --> 20:07.201
How is she not good enough for you?

286
20:07.201 --> 20:08.800
Quite the opposite.

287
20:08.800 --> 20:10.921
I admire her very much.

288
20:10.921 --> 20:15.841
On the contrary, I'm not a good choice for her.

289
20:15.841 --> 20:18.800
Most importantly, I'm not working with

290
20:18.800 --> 20:20.520
the Zhao and He families.

291
20:20.520 --> 20:22.641
I'm working with Xu Zhi Ying herself.

292
20:24.480 --> 20:26.401
You're a smart person.

293
20:30.441 --> 20:32.040
So, am I.

294
20:32.040 --> 20:34.441
I think neither of us

295
20:34.441 --> 20:36.961
needs a marriage to work together.

296
20:36.961 --> 20:38.840
My thoughts exactly.

297
20:39.800 --> 20:41.401
To a happy partnership.

298
20:43.040 --> 20:44.800
To a happy partnership.

299
20:48.361 --> 20:49.800
You don't dislike her,

300
20:49.800 --> 20:53.921
but you're unwilling to marry.

301
20:55.161 --> 20:56.520
Why?

302
20:58.080 --> 21:00.800
Do you have someone you like?

303
21:00.800 --> 21:02.201
Tell me.

304
21:02.961 --> 21:05.520
What kind of person are they?

305
21:05.520 --> 21:06.681
Not yet.

306
21:06.681 --> 21:08.481
Zhao Sheng Ge.

307
21:09.240 --> 21:12.121
Don't test my limits.

308
21:12.121 --> 21:14.921
I have plenty of ways to find out.

309
21:14.921 --> 21:17.401
I don't think you'll be able to.

310
21:18.121 --> 21:19.921
If that day ever comes,

311
21:19.921 --> 21:21.641
if there is such a person,

312
21:21.641 --> 21:23.080
I'll definitely seize the opportunity

313
21:23.080 --> 21:24.800
and not let them go.

314
21:24.800 --> 21:26.641
When they come to me,

315
21:26.641 --> 21:29.720
they won't belong to the Zhaos, nor to Minglong.

316
21:29.720 --> 21:30.720
They won't belong to any of

317
21:30.720 --> 21:33.841
the rules and standards in your head.

318
21:33.841 --> 21:35.681
They will only belong to me.

319
21:37.121 --> 21:38.441
Get some rest.

320
21:38.441 --> 21:40.161
Don't worry about so much.

321
21:40.161 --> 21:41.961
It's not good for your health.

322
21:44.280 --> 21:46.040
Zhao Sheng Ge!

323
21:48.361 --> 21:49.800
Do you still...

324
21:49.800 --> 21:51.761
hate me?

325
21:53.800 --> 21:57.320
Is it because of those burnt models?

326
21:58.441 --> 22:00.560
Or is it because of that poor dog

327
22:00.560 --> 22:03.641
who was shot in the head?

328
22:03.641 --> 22:05.720
I don't have time to hate you.

329
22:05.720 --> 22:08.681
But in the afterlife, you can ask Bo Zhu

330
22:08.681 --> 22:10.681
if she hates you.

331
22:10.681 --> 22:12.201
Bo Zhu?

332
22:19.080 --> 22:20.921
Bo Zhu.

333
22:26.040 --> 22:28.721
He mentioned Bo Zhu.

334
23:19.440 --> 23:21.960
[Did you read fairy tales as a child? Like Sleeping Beauty...]

335
23:21.960 --> 23:28.160
[Yeah? I read then with Tan You Ming. You've never read them?]

336
23:28.160 --> 23:34.760
[Nope, just saw one.]

337
23:51.000 --> 23:52.525
Ma'am.

338
23:52.525 --> 23:54.201
I think I can be discharged now.

339
23:54.201 --> 23:56.641
I've already applied with the doctor.

340
23:56.641 --> 23:58.841
Mr. Chen, your health is more important.

341
23:58.841 --> 24:00.601
Rest for a few more days.

342
24:00.601 --> 24:03.320
There's no end to making money.

343
24:03.320 --> 24:04.760
I'm mostly recovered.

344
24:04.760 --> 24:06.080
There's a lot to do at my company.

345
24:06.080 --> 24:08.520
Many people are waiting for me.

346
24:09.441 --> 24:10.601
I haven't seen anyone

347
24:10.601 --> 24:13.560
as easy to care for as you in a long time.

348
24:13.560 --> 24:15.760
You eat whatever I cook.

349
24:15.760 --> 24:17.681
You drink the soup when I tell you to.

350
24:17.681 --> 24:19.800
You eat the fruit when I tell you to.

351
24:19.800 --> 24:21.560
You were so seriously injured,

352
24:21.560 --> 24:24.401
yet no one from your family came.

353
24:24.401 --> 24:26.720
I have you to look after me, don't I?

354
24:26.720 --> 24:28.800
I haven't had such good food in a long time.

355
24:28.800 --> 24:30.121
Once you're discharged,

356
24:30.121 --> 24:33.760
I won't be able to look after you anymore.

357
24:33.760 --> 24:35.061
Ma'am.

358
24:36.361 --> 24:38.601
This is a small token of my thanks.

359
24:38.601 --> 24:39.800
There's no need.

360
24:39.800 --> 24:41.361
This is my job.

361
24:41.361 --> 24:44.040
My employer has already paid me extra.

362
24:44.040 --> 24:46.921
I'll be going now. Get some rest.

363
25:14.240 --> 25:15.441
Hello, Mom.

364
25:15.441 --> 25:17.201
Hello, darling. What's the matter?

365
25:17.201 --> 25:19.441
I'm playing mahjong with some ladies.

366
25:19.441 --> 25:20.921
Trio!

367
25:20.921 --> 25:23.320
Darling, what is it?

368
25:24.161 --> 25:25.600
Nothing much.

369
25:43.361 --> 25:45.121
- Hello? - Wan.

370
25:45.121 --> 25:47.200
Zhi Xuan said you'll be discharged soon.

371
25:47.200 --> 25:49.880
It's only a few days. What's the rush?

372
25:50.841 --> 25:52.000
Aside from the external injuries,

373
25:52.000 --> 25:53.681
hospitalization is just for observation.

374
25:53.681 --> 25:54.707
It's been several days.

375
25:54.707 --> 25:56.240
I'm not dizzy or nauseous.

376
25:56.240 --> 25:57.841
I don't want to stay in the hospital.

377
25:57.841 --> 25:59.520
Worried about your company again, huh?

378
25:59.520 --> 26:00.520
Don't worry.

379
26:00.520 --> 26:03.320
As long as I'm afloat, you won't go hungry.

380
26:03.320 --> 26:05.201
Right, Nian?

381
26:05.201 --> 26:06.961
Get to the point.

382
26:08.201 --> 26:10.080
We're planning to throw you a party

383
26:10.080 --> 26:12.641
when you get discharged.

384
26:13.760 --> 26:15.000
Sure.

385
26:15.000 --> 26:16.880
Invite everyone over.

386
26:16.880 --> 26:18.361
It's a way to thank everyone

387
26:18.361 --> 26:20.681
for taking care of me lately.

388
26:20.681 --> 26:22.401
Sure, I agree.

389
26:22.401 --> 26:24.240
Then next Saturday at seven.

390
26:24.240 --> 26:25.961
Don't worry about the venue.

391
26:25.961 --> 26:27.201
I'll handle it.

392
26:27.201 --> 26:29.000
You just notify everyone.

393
26:29.000 --> 26:31.560
Okay. Thanks for the help, Mr. Tan.

394
26:31.560 --> 26:32.880
Okay.

395
26:43.647 --> 26:44.681
Zhi Xuan.

396
26:44.681 --> 26:47.161
Do you know about the party on Saturday?

397
26:48.720 --> 26:50.406
Hey, Mr. Jiang.

398
26:50.406 --> 26:52.733
I'm much better now.

399
26:52.733 --> 26:53.760
Thanks for your concern.

400
26:53.760 --> 26:57.080
Mr. Tan set up a party for Saturday.

401
26:57.080 --> 26:58.401
Okay, sure.

402
26:58.401 --> 26:59.800
See you then.

403
27:55.921 --> 27:57.681
Hello, Mr. Chen.

404
27:57.681 --> 27:59.000
Hello, Viola.

405
27:59.000 --> 28:00.760
This is Chen Wan.

406
28:00.760 --> 28:04.000
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

407
28:04.000 --> 28:06.641
I'm hosting a party this Saturday.

408
28:06.641 --> 28:07.641
It's to thank everyone

409
28:07.641 --> 28:09.921
for taking care of me during this time.

410
28:09.921 --> 28:13.680
If it's okay, I'd like to invite Mr. Zhao.

411
28:13.680 --> 28:15.201
Of course, Mr. Chen.

412
28:15.201 --> 28:18.361
I'll convey your invitation to Mr. Zhao.

413
28:18.361 --> 28:22.441
However, for a personal invitation like this,

414
28:22.441 --> 28:24.841
you might want to contact him yourself.

415
28:24.841 --> 28:27.121
It's only Tuesday, so there's still time.

416
28:27.121 --> 28:29.560
The chances of him accepting will be higher.

417
28:29.560 --> 28:31.800
Do you have his number?

418
28:31.800 --> 28:32.841
Yes, I do.

419
28:32.841 --> 28:34.280
Thank you, Viola.

420
28:34.280 --> 28:35.921
You're very welcome.

421
28:46.601 --> 28:48.560
Lukas.

422
28:48.560 --> 28:50.000
What day is it today?

423
28:50.000 --> 28:52.121
It's Friday, Mr. Zhao.

424
28:52.121 --> 28:55.280
Have there been any dinner invitations lately?

425
28:55.280 --> 28:57.601
I'll have Viola send you the schedule.

426
28:57.601 --> 29:00.080
Never mind, forget it.

427
29:10.847 --> 29:12.768
Hello, Mr. Chen.

428
29:13.740 --> 29:15.900
Yes, but...

429
29:21.180 --> 29:24.280
Sir, they caught the guys who hit Ms. Xu.

430
29:24.280 --> 29:25.620
What were they charged with?

431
29:25.620 --> 29:28.080
It seems it was just a hit-and-run.

432
29:28.080 --> 29:29.080
They almost killed someone.

433
29:29.080 --> 29:31.560
And they're only being charged with a hit-and-run?

434
29:31.560 --> 29:33.280
How are the police handling this?

435
29:33.280 --> 29:35.601
Was Ms. Xu injured that badly?

436
29:35.601 --> 29:38.080
Then this is attempted murder.

437
29:38.760 --> 29:40.961
Are there no other charges?

438
29:40.961 --> 29:43.800
You can help with the investigation, too.

439
29:44.800 --> 29:45.841
I understand, sir.

440
29:45.841 --> 29:47.481
I'll look into it right away.

441
29:57.000 --> 29:59.040
Hello, Mr. Chen.

442
29:59.841 --> 30:03.720
Mr. Zhao's schedule is usually handled by Viola.

443
30:03.720 --> 30:04.981
She's currently on a business trip.

444
30:04.981 --> 30:06.041
I'll need to verify everything

445
30:06.041 --> 30:07.961
before I can give you a definite answer.

446
30:07.961 --> 30:09.254
I'm very sorry.

447
30:09.254 --> 30:10.961
All right, thank you for your help.

448
30:10.961 --> 30:12.520
But Mr. Chen, here's the thing.

449
30:12.520 --> 30:14.841
Weekends are usually Mr. Zhao's personal time.

450
30:14.841 --> 30:17.361
We can't guarantee we'll reach him.

451
30:17.361 --> 30:20.800
If it's urgent, it's best to call him yourself.

452
30:20.800 --> 30:23.721
I think that might be more efficient.

453
30:24.560 --> 30:26.240
Call him directly?

454
30:26.240 --> 30:28.720
Won't that be a bother to Mr. Zhao?

455
30:28.720 --> 30:29.720
Don't worry.

456
30:29.720 --> 30:32.201
If Mr. Zhao doesn't want to be disturbed,

457
30:32.201 --> 30:34.266
you won't be able to reach him anyway.

458
30:34.266 --> 30:36.040
All right, I'll try.

459
30:36.040 --> 30:38.320
- Thank you, Mr. He. - Happy to help.

460
30:38.320 --> 30:39.721
Goodbye.

461
30:40.961 --> 30:42.480
Don't forget.

462
30:42.480 --> 30:44.040
You're on a business trip.

463
30:44.040 --> 30:45.880
I know.

464
31:00.400 --> 31:02.080
Mr. Zhao, tonight at 9:00 P.M.,

465
31:02.080 --> 31:03.720
the online meeting with the overseas branch

466
31:03.720 --> 31:05.240
has been arranged.

467
31:05.240 --> 31:06.760
Good.

468
31:06.760 --> 31:10.681
Mr. Zhao, should I note down your weekend schedule?

469
31:16.840 --> 31:20.800
[Zhao Sheng Ge]

470
31:32.401 --> 31:34.600
Sir, what are your thoughts on the new proposal?

471
31:34.600 --> 31:35.880
[Chen Wan]

472
31:38.000 --> 31:40.641
Regarding the overall direction of this proposal...

473
31:40.641 --> 31:42.000
Everyone, something has come up.

474
31:42.000 --> 31:43.481
I'm logging off now.

475
31:57.320 --> 31:59.361
Chen Wan.

476
31:59.361 --> 32:00.641
Hello?

477
32:01.641 --> 32:03.720
Is this Mr. Zhao?

478
32:03.720 --> 32:05.121
What is it?

479
32:05.121 --> 32:07.121
Here's the thing.

480
32:07.121 --> 32:09.480
I was in the hospital a few days ago,

481
32:09.480 --> 32:10.840
and I'm very grateful to everyone

482
32:10.840 --> 32:12.280
for taking care of me during that time.

483
32:12.280 --> 32:15.320
So, I'm planning to host a discharge party

484
32:15.320 --> 32:17.401
to have dinner with everyone.

485
32:17.401 --> 32:20.681
I was wondering if you might be free to attend.

486
32:21.440 --> 32:23.240
Are you inviting me?

487
32:23.240 --> 32:25.040
Yes, Mr. Zhao.

488
32:25.040 --> 32:28.201
I would like to invite you.

489
32:28.201 --> 32:31.560
It's set for Saturday at 7:00 P.M.

490
32:31.560 --> 32:35.040
It's already 10:00 P.M. on Friday now.

491
32:36.841 --> 32:38.201
It was too abrupt of me.

492
32:38.201 --> 32:40.401
I should have invited you earlier.

493
32:40.401 --> 32:45.800
So, would you happen to have time this Saturday night?

494
32:45.800 --> 32:48.921
Did you call my assistant on Tuesday?

495
32:48.921 --> 32:51.000
Yes.

496
32:51.000 --> 32:55.240
He told me that a Mr. Chen had requested a meeting.

497
32:55.240 --> 32:58.120
But I didn't know which Mr. Chen it was.

498
32:58.921 --> 33:00.961
I might have forgotten to leave my name.

499
33:00.961 --> 33:02.800
But since I hadn't received a reply,

500
33:02.800 --> 33:04.040
I took the liberty

501
33:04.040 --> 33:07.040
of calling your personal number.

502
33:07.040 --> 33:09.201
I hope I'm not disturbing you.

503
33:10.161 --> 33:12.720
So, you have my personal number.

504
33:12.720 --> 33:14.800
You gave it to me.

505
33:14.800 --> 33:16.681
The night I was hospitalized.

506
33:16.681 --> 33:18.600
Have you forgotten?

507
33:20.280 --> 33:22.001
I remember now.

508
33:23.441 --> 33:26.401
So, will you come tomorrow night?

509
33:26.401 --> 33:28.881
Who else is going?

510
33:28.881 --> 33:32.641
Mr. Tan, Mr. Shen, Mr. Jiang...

511
33:32.641 --> 33:35.031
- And some others. - Then why did you invite me?

512
33:38.320 --> 33:41.361
You helped me a lot while I was in hospital.

513
33:41.361 --> 33:42.850
You even arranged for a nanny.

514
33:42.850 --> 33:45.325
I haven't had the chance to thank you properly.

515
33:45.325 --> 33:46.891
I see.

516
33:49.540 --> 33:51.753
I'll see how things go.

517
33:51.753 --> 33:53.699
If I have time, I'll be there.

518
33:53.699 --> 33:55.979
All right. Goodbye, Mr. Zhao.

519
34:03.646 --> 34:05.409
Chen Wan.

520
34:05.409 --> 34:07.209
Goodbye.

521
34:53.887 --> 34:55.990
Wait until all the guests arrive before serving the wine.

522
34:55.990 --> 34:59.201
Thank you. Sure, I'll get things ready.

523
35:02.127 --> 35:04.206
You're here.

524
35:04.973 --> 35:07.181
How are you? Are you feeling better?

525
35:07.181 --> 35:08.532
Much better.

526
35:08.532 --> 35:10.375
You look fine indeed.

527
35:13.260 --> 35:15.060
What's with you now?

528
35:15.928 --> 35:18.353
Wan, have you heard?

529
35:18.353 --> 35:21.622
The guys who hit you have been caught.

530
35:21.622 --> 35:24.625
They were arrested on a visa-free island.

531
35:25.845 --> 35:29.462
Word is, Zhao Sheng Ge took them directly from the police.

532
35:29.462 --> 35:32.429
He said there are other crimes that haven't been uncovered yet.

533
35:32.429 --> 35:34.574
Zhao Sheng Ge wants to investigate personally.

534
35:34.574 --> 35:36.513
No one knows the details now.

535
35:36.513 --> 35:39.124
Whether they're alive or not, or how they're being handled...

536
35:39.124 --> 35:40.939
no one knows a thing.

537
35:40.939 --> 35:43.563
Wan, I think something's not right.

538
35:43.563 --> 35:44.668
What's not right?

539
35:44.668 --> 35:48.173
Look, Zhao Sheng Ge rarely intervenes personally.

540
35:48.173 --> 35:50.654
Those guys aren't worth his time.

541
35:51.801 --> 35:55.600
Besides, why would he go to all that trouble

542
35:55.600 --> 35:58.480
for a few hired guns who are clearly tools?

543
35:58.480 --> 36:00.200
It's no different from alerting the enemy.

544
36:00.200 --> 36:02.241
He has no reason to do that.

545
36:03.160 --> 36:05.081
Unless...

546
36:05.841 --> 36:08.280
Unless he wants to avenge you.

547
36:09.761 --> 36:11.961
I think you're overthinking it.

548
36:11.961 --> 36:14.760
Even if Zhao Sheng Ge caught them himself,

549
36:14.760 --> 36:17.401
it's to find the remnants of Baihe Hall.

550
36:17.401 --> 36:18.560
It has nothing to do with me.

551
36:18.560 --> 36:19.680
Don't think too much about it.

552
36:19.680 --> 36:20.921
Don't overthink it.

553
36:20.921 --> 36:22.320
Wan.

554
36:24.040 --> 36:26.000
I wasn't in Hai City for a while,

555
36:26.000 --> 36:27.921
so I didn't get to visit you in the hospital.

556
36:27.921 --> 36:31.160
I hope you don't mind me dropping by unannounced today.

557
36:31.160 --> 36:32.441
Of course not, Mr. Qin.

558
36:32.441 --> 36:33.600
Any visitor is a guest.

559
36:33.600 --> 36:35.041
This way, please.

560
36:36.040 --> 36:37.600
Wan.

561
36:37.600 --> 36:40.680
- Hello. - You're finally out of the hospital.

562
36:40.680 --> 36:43.040
- How have you been lately? - Not bad.

563
36:43.040 --> 36:44.840
- This way, please. - Okay.

564
36:48.200 --> 36:50.120
Everyone, the food has been ordered.

565
36:50.120 --> 36:52.040
Please, enjoy your meal.

566
36:52.040 --> 36:53.681
Waiter.

567
36:56.281 --> 36:57.321
I'm sorry.

568
36:57.321 --> 36:59.320
The traffic was a bit heavy.

569
37:00.520 --> 37:02.440
Mr. Qin is here too?

570
37:07.160 --> 37:10.640
Come on. Let's all wish Wan a full recovery.

571
37:10.640 --> 37:12.080
Okay, thank you.

572
37:12.080 --> 37:14.120
Since you just got out of the hospital,

573
37:14.120 --> 37:15.641
you should stick to tea.

574
37:20.401 --> 37:21.694
Okay.

575
37:37.468 --> 37:40.000
- Please enjoy. - Okay, thank you.

576
37:42.881 --> 37:44.961
Mr. Zhao, would you like to try some?

577
37:44.961 --> 37:47.040
It's a nourishing coconut and seafood stew.

578
37:47.040 --> 37:48.600
It's been slow-simmered for hours.

579
37:48.600 --> 37:50.601
It's very good for the stomach.

580
37:51.480 --> 37:52.880
All right.

581
38:11.841 --> 38:13.560
Thank you.

582
38:13.560 --> 38:15.201
You're very welcome.

583
38:25.080 --> 38:27.361
- Okay, thank you. - Please enjoy your meal.

584
38:27.361 --> 38:28.520
Mr. Zhao.

585
38:28.520 --> 38:32.000
This is a full-sized Typhoon Shelter deep-sea crab.

586
38:32.000 --> 38:33.640
They only serve them once they're fully grown.

587
38:33.640 --> 38:36.360
The meat is sweet and fresh.

588
38:37.721 --> 38:39.000
Mr. Zhao.

589
38:39.000 --> 38:41.721
Let me serve some for you to try.

590
38:42.480 --> 38:44.120
Then I'll trouble you.

591
38:57.921 --> 38:59.881
I'm so sorry, Mr. Zhao.

592
38:59.881 --> 39:01.480
It's no matter.

593
39:13.321 --> 39:15.000
Mr. Chen, the gifts sent by the guests

594
39:15.000 --> 39:16.881
have all been safely stored in the back.

595
39:16.881 --> 39:19.040
This is the gift list. Would you like to check it?

596
39:19.040 --> 39:21.601
No need. Thanks for your hard work.

597
39:27.361 --> 39:28.681
Chen Wan.

598
39:34.321 --> 39:36.000
By the way, Zhi Xuan...

599
39:36.000 --> 39:39.041
You should renovate your hotel when you have the time.

600
39:44.321 --> 39:45.721
Mr. Zhao.

601
39:45.721 --> 39:48.000
I didn't invite Mr. Qin.

602
39:50.160 --> 39:51.961
He didn't know I was hospitalized.

603
39:51.961 --> 39:53.520
I didn't tell him either.

604
39:53.520 --> 39:56.961
He must have heard from Mr. Tan and came on his own.

605
39:56.961 --> 39:58.840
I don't care about that.

606
39:59.520 --> 40:00.721
Chen Wan.

607
40:00.721 --> 40:02.320
Do you have a cigarette?

608
40:02.921 --> 40:04.280
I do.

609
40:56.560 --> 40:57.880
A new one?

610
40:58.580 --> 40:59.887
Yes.

611
41:00.600 --> 41:02.801
It's quite special.

612
41:02.801 --> 41:04.560
Chen Wan.

613
41:04.560 --> 41:07.241
I didn't bring you a gift.

614
41:07.241 --> 41:08.921
You don't have to say that, Mr. Zhao.

615
41:08.921 --> 41:11.000
I sent the invitation so late.

616
41:11.000 --> 41:13.000
I didn't know what you liked.

617
41:13.000 --> 41:15.320
I didn't want to give you something perfunctory.

618
41:16.761 --> 41:17.841
In a little while, let's go together...

619
41:17.841 --> 41:19.921
and pick out a gift for you.

620
41:19.921 --> 41:22.721
I'm the one who should be thanking you the most.

621
41:22.721 --> 41:23.721
Mr. Zhao.

622
41:23.721 --> 41:25.120
When I was in the hospital,

623
41:25.120 --> 41:27.120
you already hired security and a caretaker for me.

624
41:27.120 --> 41:29.120
That's what I should have done.

625
41:29.120 --> 41:31.320
It's nothing.

626
41:39.680 --> 41:41.441
Chen Wan.

627
41:41.441 --> 41:43.721
You're in the energy transfer business.

628
41:45.560 --> 41:47.361
Do you like it?

629
41:47.361 --> 41:48.800
I do.

630
41:49.721 --> 41:51.881
Is your focus more technical or commercial?

631
41:51.881 --> 41:53.881
It's more on the technical side.

632
41:53.881 --> 41:55.480
Then how is it that...

633
41:55.480 --> 41:57.120
when it comes to PR,

634
41:57.120 --> 41:58.361
you're also very good at it?

635
41:58.361 --> 42:00.241
If I didn't understand PR,

636
42:00.241 --> 42:03.920
I'm afraid I wouldn't even have a chance to apply my technical skills.

637
42:04.640 --> 42:06.560
You have a very impressive resume.

638
42:06.560 --> 42:08.640
The derivative project for Minglong's Lychee Bay project

639
42:08.640 --> 42:11.640
the Sea Oil Tunnel, requires high-speed oil storage production

640
42:11.640 --> 42:13.241
and installation engineering.

641
42:13.241 --> 42:15.281
I mentioned this to you before.

642
42:15.281 --> 42:18.041
I wonder if you're interested.

643
42:18.841 --> 42:22.040
Mr. Zhao, are you serious?

644
42:22.040 --> 42:23.321
A project like this is so good,

645
42:23.321 --> 42:25.640
everyone is fighting for it.

646
42:25.640 --> 42:27.721
It would be a great opportunity for me.

647
42:27.721 --> 42:31.361
To be honest, Kexiang has bid for it before.

648
42:31.361 --> 42:33.801
But I'm planning to withdraw the bid now.

649
42:33.801 --> 42:35.881
Your biggest competitor is gone.

650
42:35.881 --> 42:37.801
Why are you withdrawing the bid instead?

651
42:37.801 --> 42:40.160
At the time, it was mainly to deal with Luo Gan Sheng.

652
42:40.160 --> 42:42.640
But now that I've calmed down and thought about it,

653
42:42.640 --> 42:44.281
Lychee Bay is such a massive project...

654
42:44.281 --> 42:45.441
Chen Wan.

655
42:45.441 --> 42:47.667
You're questioning my judgment again.

656
42:47.667 --> 42:48.680
I'm not.

657
42:48.680 --> 42:51.561
Minglong has a very professional evaluation team.

658
42:52.441 --> 42:54.520
I suggest you continue with the bid.

659
42:54.520 --> 42:55.600
Whether you win the bid or not

660
42:55.600 --> 42:57.160
is up to the evaluation team.

661
42:57.160 --> 42:59.200
I won't interfere.

662
42:59.200 --> 43:01.841
This line was originally in the hands of Baihe Hall.

663
43:01.841 --> 43:05.280
Now, after Minglong and Baisheng took over,

664
43:06.193 --> 43:08.674
I'm not comfortable leaving it to others.

665
43:09.401 --> 43:11.081
Besides...

666
43:14.881 --> 43:17.440
Didn't you crash your way into this?

667
43:18.680 --> 43:20.681
Me, crashing in?

668
43:21.961 --> 43:23.321
Saving Xu Zhi Ying that day

669
43:23.321 --> 43:25.241
was just a spur-of-the-moment thing.

670
43:25.241 --> 43:27.600
I'm just worried Kexiang can't keep up.

671
43:27.600 --> 43:30.401
With Minglong backing you, what's the fear?

672
43:30.401 --> 43:33.841
Besides, aren't you quite brave?

673
43:33.841 --> 43:36.361
Crossing three lanes and the median strip,

674
43:36.361 --> 43:38.080
smashing straight into that beast of a Jeep

675
43:38.080 --> 43:40.401
and the Grand Cherokee's engine.

676
43:40.401 --> 43:42.800
Yet, you're afraid to take Minglong's offer?

677
43:43.961 --> 43:46.761
How did you know about all that, Mr. Zhao?

678
43:46.761 --> 43:50.080
Once at the hearing, and again on the Coastal Highway.

679
43:50.080 --> 43:51.920
How could I not know?

680
43:54.321 --> 43:56.160
You can take your time to think about it.

681
43:56.160 --> 43:57.801
No need to rush your answer.

682
43:57.801 --> 44:00.480
Don't view this as compensation, either.

683
44:00.480 --> 44:03.480
I simply hope you'll continue with the bid.

684
44:03.480 --> 44:05.801
If you do win the bid,

685
44:05.801 --> 44:08.281
Minglong will be a very demanding client.

686
44:08.281 --> 44:10.961
The project manager is also very difficult.

687
44:10.961 --> 44:12.321
If, during the collaboration,

688
44:12.321 --> 44:15.520
you fail to deliver satisfactory results,

689
44:15.520 --> 44:16.761
we will hold you accountable

690
44:16.761 --> 44:18.721
to the fullest extent.

691
44:20.120 --> 44:22.160
Let me know once you've thought it through.

692
44:22.160 --> 44:24.201
Call me directly.

693
44:26.040 --> 44:27.921
Chen Wan.

694
44:27.921 --> 44:29.880
You have my number, right?

695
44:30.841 --> 44:32.280
I do.

696
44:39.280 --> 44:40.321
Mr. Zhao.

697
44:40.321 --> 44:42.960
Give it to me. I'll throw it away for you.

698
44:44.480 --> 44:46.160
No need.

699
44:46.160 --> 44:47.561
Okay.

700
44:50.520 --> 44:52.480
Fine, I won't mention it again.

701
44:52.480 --> 44:54.521
That guy who was competing with you...

702
44:58.281 --> 45:00.961
Mr. Zhao, you haven't left yet?

703
45:00.961 --> 45:02.120
I still owe you a gift.

704
45:02.120 --> 45:03.401
Do you remember?

705
45:03.401 --> 45:04.520
Let's go.

706
45:04.520 --> 45:06.241
I'll take you to pick one out.

707
45:06.241 --> 45:07.840
Get in the car.

708
45:08.841 --> 45:11.120
There's a mall nearby.

709
45:11.120 --> 45:14.640
Or is there somewhere else you'd like to go?

710
45:14.640 --> 45:16.161
Anywhere is fine.

711
45:17.160 --> 45:19.921
But is it okay for you to go out like this?

712
45:19.921 --> 45:21.840
They won't recognize me.

713
45:24.961 --> 45:26.800
You can head back first.

714
45:50.921 --> 45:52.360
Chen Wan.

715
45:53.881 --> 45:56.640
Am I driving too fast?

716
45:56.640 --> 45:57.960
No.

717
46:04.721 --> 46:06.681
Mr. Zhao, let me do it.

718
46:45.361 --> 46:47.161
I'll get out first.

719
46:48.921 --> 46:50.477
Do you need help?

720
46:50.477 --> 46:51.801
No, thank you.

721
46:55.520 --> 46:56.840
I've got it.
